Upstream attribution
--------------------
openviking-kiro is derived from, and built on, the agent-hook-plugin
framework of OpenViking:

  Project:  OpenViking
  Source:   https://github.com/volcengine/OpenViking
  Path:     examples/agent-hook-plugin/
  License:  GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0)

What comes from upstream:

- scripts/hook.mjs, scripts/uri-guard.mjs and hosts/index.mjs are adapted from
  the files of the same name in examples/agent-hook-plugin/ (modified to
  register the Kiro host).
- servers/mcp-proxy.mjs has the same content as the upstream file of the same
  name.
- hosts/kiro.mjs follows the structure of the upstream ZCode host
  (examples/agent-hook-plugin/hosts/zcode.mjs).
- hosts/incremental-turn-capture.mjs is a verbatim, unmodified copy of
  examples/agent-hook-plugin/hosts/incremental-turn-capture.mjs from upstream
  commit 03391bae4335eacf440a62d942f3951de6a63cbe (2026-09-23). Upstream has
  changed that file since; this copy has not been updated to follow it.
- At run time this package imports the OpenViking shared runtime
  (memory-plugin-shared/lib) from the user's own OpenViking installation under
  ~/.openviking/agent-integrations/. That runtime is not included in this
  repository.

The Kiro-specific parts (hosts/kiro*.mjs, the installer and uninstaller, the
Kiro assets, and the tests) were written for this project.

This is an unofficial community project. It is not affiliated with or
endorsed by Volcengine or the OpenViking maintainers.
